OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStarting off dry and bright
OL,6,Fespecially in the east. Clouding over
OL,7,Fduring the morning with rain spreading
OL,8,Feast during the afternoon, turning
OL,9,Flight and patchy later with parts of
OL,10,FGalloway seeing a dry end to the day,
OL,11,Fstill quite wind.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain dying out and cloud
OL,14,Fbreaking with the chance of some
OL,15,Fevening sun towards East Lothian.
OL,16,FClear spells overnight, but a few
OL,17,Fshowers too, windy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
