OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA blustery day with showers
OL,6,Fand strong, gusty winds, perhaps some
OL,7,Fshelter for the Borders, mainly dry
OL,8,Fwith sunshine here.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStarting
OL,11,Fshowery again Sunday but brightening
OL,12,Fup and winds easing in the afternoon,
OL,13,Fa pleasant end to the weekend. Some
OL,14,Fspells of rain and westerly winds for
OL,15,Fthe new week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
